{"step_index":675,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:36:57Z","thinking":"The function `func_109E09` validates a mission ID against a list of valid story mission IDs, returning a success indication if a match is found. Investigating the mission dependency graph reveals the next step involves scanning RPF payloads for GXT2 localization tables to resolve the `display_name` attribute within task 2.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"python -c \\\"\\nimport os\\n\\nbase_dirs = [\\n    r'C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\Downloads\\\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\\\work',\\n    r'C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\Downloads\\\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK'\\n]\\n\\ngxt2_magics = [b'GXT2', b'2TXG', b'\\\\x47\\\\x58\\\\x54\\\\x32', b'\\\\x32\\\\x54\\\\x58\\\\x47']\\n\\nfound_files = []\\n\\nfor base in base_dirs:\\n    for root, dirs, files in os.walk(base):\\n        # avoid rescanning work/ if already in base_dirs\\n        if base != base_dirs[0] and root.startswith(base_dirs[0]):\\n            continue\\n        for f in files:\\n            fp = os.path.join(root, f)\\n            try:\\n                # check first 64 bytes or file size\\n                sz = os.path.getsize(fp)\\n                if sz < 4: continue\\n                with open(fp, 'rb') as bin_f:\\n                    header = bin_f.read(64)\\n                    for magic in gxt2_magics:\\n                        if magic in header:\\n                            found_files.append((fp, magic, 0, sz))\\n                            break\\n                    else:\\n                        # also search in small/medium binary files (< 50MB) for embedded GXT2\\n                        if sz < 50 * 1024 * 1024:\\n                            bin_f.seek(0)\\n                            content = bin_f.read()\\n                            for magic in gxt2_magics:\\n                                idx = content.find(magic)\\n               